453767\" title=\"Tatoeba · peipei\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · peipei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">執着</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうちゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">执着；执念；坚持；固着；痴迷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100102\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>弁護士<rp>(</rp><rt>べんごし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になれるという<ruby>希望<rp>(</rp><rt>きぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>執着<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうちゃく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他渴望成为一名律师。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集中</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">专注；集中注意力；集中；聚集；集权；汇聚；（讨论、问题等的）焦点；（作品）集中；收录于作品集内</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154790\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>読書<rp>(</rp><rt>どくしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>集中<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我专心看书</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">終点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">终点；终站</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220781\">この<ruby>線<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>終点<rp